//FAM A — DAY 3 — VERA'S CLOTHES (WARM)
title: FamA
when: ($day == 3) && ($package == "clothes")
color: green
group: FamA && Day3
position: -1641,933
---
//FAM A — DAY 3 — VERA'S CLOTHES (WARM)
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaListeningTired">>
Mailman: Good afternoon Lina!
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSpeakingTired">>
Lina: Hello Mr.Mailman. I don't think I ordered anything else...
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaListeningTired">>
Mailman: This one is addressed to Sofie.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieSpeakingTired">>
Sofie: To... me?
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieListeningTired">>
Mailman: That's right. It's from Vera, your Neighbour.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieSpeakingTired">>
Sofie: Vera? I don't think I know her.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieListeningTired">>
Mailman: She has the cutest little boy, that's probably why you haven't seen her much. That boy is a piece of work.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSSpeakingTired">>
Lina: Oh that's just perfect, we've been looking for something Sofie could do after school, she could babysit the boy from time to time. What do you think Sofie?
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieSpeakingTired">>
Sofie: Oh yeah, it would be awesome and I can also thank her for the package. I'll you write her a note, could you give it to her Mr.Mailman?
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieListeningTired">>
Mailman: Of course! I'm sure she we'll be excited to have an evening to relax.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieSpeakingTired">>
Sofie: Here you have the note, I wrote my number in case she wants to contact me.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieListeningTired">>
Mailman: I'll take it to her as soon as I can. You two have a lovely evening.
<<hideCharacter "Lina">>
<<hideBackground>>
===

