//FAM A — DAY 4 — BABYSITTING (1ST TIME DAMAGED)
<<showBackground "BGFamA">>
<<showCharacter "Lina" "ListeningTired">>
Mailman: Good afternoon Lina.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSpeakingTired">>
Lina: Good afternoon Mr.Mailman.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "ListeningTired">>
Mailman: How is Sofie doing?
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSpeakingTired">>
Lina: Oh, she's great. She's helping Vera and Jonas, since it's her first time babysitting they also invited their niece to help her out. It's nice since their niece attends the same school as Sofie.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "ListeningTired">>
Mailman: Oh! Tha's amazing, I hope they can get along.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSpeakingTired">>
Lina: Yes, I am really grateful. So, what do you have for me today?
<<showCharacter "Lina" "ListeningTired">>
Mailman: I think these are your groceries.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSpeakingTired">>
Lina: Thank you! This is a bit damaged though.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "ListeningTired">>
Mailman: I'm so sorry, today's drive was a bit rough.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSpeakingTired">>
Lina: As long as my eggs are okay…
<<showCharacter "Lina" "ListeningTired">>
Mailman: I am really sorry, I'll make sure to be more careful next time.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSpeakingTired">>
Lina: It's okay, these things happen. I'm just learning new recipes and I needed some ingredients. 
<<showCharacter "Lina" "ListeningTired">>
Mailman: That sounds so good, really.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSpeakingTired">>
Lina: For now I made a batch of chocolate chip cookies, I made some extra so you could give them to our neighbours.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "ListeningTired">>
Mailman: That is amazing, they're going to be so happy. You are too kind.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSpeakingTired">>
Lina: I wanted to give something nice back to our community. Now I feel like I'm part of a big family. 
<<showCharacter "Lina" "ListeningTired">>
-> Mailman: I'm glad you feel that way, I can assure you they feel the same way (+1)
    <<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSpeakingTired">>
	Lina: This wouldn't have been possible without you Mr.Mailman, you have done a lot for this community.
    <<showCharacter "Lina" "ListeningTired">>
	Mailman: I only deliver, take care Lina.
    <<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSpeakingTired">>
	Lina: You too Mr.Mailman.

->Mailman: That's nice, see you tomorrow

===
